{"3474150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Hazard", "steam_appid": 3474150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a zero-gravity space station twisted by a corrupted AI, you must survive a labyrinth of shifting corridors and relentless obstacles. Scavenge for resources, upgrade your suit, and fight your way through terrifying threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels:</strong> Encounter a new layout every time you enter a level or restart after death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge for Survival:</strong> Search for weapons, ammo, and resources to increase your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management:</strong> Strategically manage your limited inventory to carry only what you need most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemy Threats:</strong> Face a variety of relentless enemies hunting you throughout the station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Suit Modules:</strong> Upgrade your suit with powerful modules to enhance your abilities and suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Story:</strong> Find logs to unveil the station’s dark secrets and the experiment that shattered reality.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a zero-gravity space station twisted by a corrupted AI, you must survive a labyrinth of shifting corridors and relentless obstacles. Scavenge for resources, upgrade your suit, and fight your way through terrifying threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels:</strong> Encounter a new layout every time you enter a level or restart after death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S